SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 9th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with H
 eart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the futur
 e\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in li
 fe :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be/v
 ei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful songw
 riting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflecti
 on and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself better
 \n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about o
 rdinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the searc
 h for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting at 
 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Fle
 mming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveF
 lemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Hear
 t (Thursday\, July 9th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs explore
  the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\, an
 d heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, blue eyed so
 ul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on themes of love
 \, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal growth
 \, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs often feature memo
 rable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\, and a deep
  curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling a story\, sharing 
 a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the sta
 te of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, compas
 sion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Songs 
 containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine cr
 aftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific fo
 lk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude\, 
 personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning.\
 n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs explore freedo
 m\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom hidden in ord
 inary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You Ca
 n: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**s
 teveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly appr
 eciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings among music love
 rs and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
