 r members too throughout the evening\n\n**Dinner Party Topics** may includ
 e but not limited too: Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, M
 odern Dating\, Work/Life balance\, Art\, Technology\, Economy\, Music\, Mo
 vies\, Sports\, Fashion\, Hobbies\, Books\, Psychology\, Philosophy\, the 
 Future\, History\, Pop Culture\, Theatre\, etc.)\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*
