SUMMARY:WALK\, TALK and ICE CREAM! (Nature\, Neighbourhoods and Pub after)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s for a wonderful and relaxed summer evening as we explore another great p
